      "end": 491.639,
      "text": "deconstructing. Run."
    },
    {
      "start": 497.599,
      "end": 504.84,
      "text": "Stop. Satis. Look. It's cloud town. That"
    },
    {
      "start": 501.44,
      "end": 504.84,
      "text": "is my favorite."
    },
    {
      "start": 505.599,
      "end": 510.639,
      "text": "Imagination Land is the best."
    },
    {
      "start": 508.639,
      "end": 512.159,
      "text": "And now I'm all set to take Riley to the"
    },
    {
      "start": 510.639,
      "end": 514.8,
      "text": "moon."
    },
    {
      "start": 512.159,
      "end": 516.88,
      "text": "Oh, I'm sorry. What? I live in Canada."
    },
    {
      "start": 514.8,
      "end": 517.8389999999999,
      "text": "Anyway, this way through preschool"
    },
    {
      "start": 516.88,
      "end": 518.8,
      "text": "world."
    },
    {
      "start": 517.839,
      "end": 520.8800000000001,
      "text": "Got to go."
    },
    {
      "start": 518.8,
      "end": 524.8389999999999,
      "text": "Okay. Good luck, sweetie."
    },
    {
      "start": 520.88,
      "end": 524.8389999999999,
      "text": "Luck isn't going to help us now."
    },
    {
      "start": 536.451,
      "end": 538.471,
      "text": "[screaming]"
    },
    {
      "start": 540.381,
      "end": 545.04,
      "text": "[laughter]"
    },
    {
      "start": 542.08,
      "end": 548.2,
      "text": "Oh no, she loves hockey. She can't give"
    },
    {
      "start": 545.04,
      "end": 548.1999999999999,
      "text": "up hockey."
    },
    {
      "start": 550.0,
      "end": 554.2,
      "text": "Oh, the stuffed animal"
    },
    {
      "start": 556.959,
      "end": 561.4799999999999,
      "text": "finally can't be done with me."
    },
    {
      "start": 564.24,
      "end": 569.32,
      "text": "How did you do that? I don't know."
    },
    {
      "start": 578.24,
      "end": 581.36,
      "text": "What is it?"
    },
    {
      "start": 578.88,
      "end": 582.399,
      "text": "Oh, nothing. Our friends."
    },
    {
      "start": 581.36,
      "end": 584.5600000000001,
      "text": "Triple gun."
    },
    {
      "start": 582.399,
      "end": 589.08,
      "text": "We'll make you smile."
    },
    {
      "start": 584.56,
      "end": 589.0799999999999,
      "text": "Rainbow unicorn. She's right there."
    },
    {
      "start": 590.0,
      "end": 594.88,
      "text": "Huh? Wonder what that means. Oh well,"
    },
    {
      "start": 592.16,
      "end": 596.7199999999999,
      "text": "let's go in. Just because Jury and"
    },
    {
      "start": 594.88,
      "end": 600.12,
      "text": "sadness are gone, I have to do stupid"
    },
    {
      "start": 596.72,
      "end": 600.12,
      "text": "dream duty."
    },
    {
      "start": 600.8,
      "end": 604.519,
      "text": "Hello, class."
    },
    {
      "start": 604.959,
      "end": 608.56,
      "text": "Gross."
    },
    {
      "start": 605.519,
      "end": 611.5600000000001,
      "text": "Teeth falling out."
    },
    {
      "start": 608.56,
      "end": 611.56,
      "text": "Park."
    },
    {
      "start": 614.399,
      "end": 619.44,
      "text": "This isn't working."
    },
    {
      "start": 617.44,
      "end": 624.399,
      "text": "They're trying to wake her up. Call"
    },
    {
      "start": 619.44,
      "end": 624.399,
      "text": "security. Pan away. Pan away."
    },
    {
      "start": 635.36,
      "end": 639.8000000000001,
      "text": "All he cared about was the candy."
    },
    {
      "start": 642.32,
      "end": 648.0790000000001,
      "text": "We're out of here. Let's get to that."
    },
    {
      "start": 644.399,
      "end": 651.64,
      "text": "Did you say birthday"
    },
    {
      "start": 648.079,
      "end": 651.64,
      "text": "cake present?"
    },
    {
      "start": 657.279,
      "end": 660.8389999999999,
      "text": "I just don't understand."
    },
    {
      "start": 669.279,
      "end": 674.8,
      "text": "Excuse me. Isn't there any way?"
    },
    {
      "start": 672.48,
      "end": 678.04,
      "text": "Wait, wait. Hang on, guys."
    },
    {
      "start": 674.8,
      "end": 678.04,
      "text": "Let's go."
    },
    {
      "start": 682.079,
      "end": 686.279,
      "text": "But that's our only way back."
    },
    {
      "start": 687.519,
      "end": 693.64,
      "text": "Have a great day, sweetheart. Riley"
    },
    {
      "start": 690.0,
      "end": 693.64,
      "text": "needs to be happy."
    },
    {
      "start": 704.56,
      "end": 707.8,
      "text": "Hop in."
    },
    {
      "start": 719.839,
      "end": 723.48,
      "text": "We're going to make it."
    },
    {
      "start": 729.519,
      "end": 734.76,
      "text": "We're home,"
    },
    {
      "start": 731.76,
      "end": 734.76,
      "text": "Riley."
    },
    {
      "start": 740.16,
      "end": 746.12,
      "text": "Everything is awful and my legs don't"
    },
    {
      "start": 743.12,
      "end": 746.12,
      "text": "work."
    },
    {
      "start": 749.6,
      "end": 755.48,
      "text": "Sadness."
    },
    {
      "start": 752.48,
      "end": 755.48,
      "text": "Sadness."
    },
    {
      "start": 758.24,
      "end": 763.04,
      "text": "Riley feel anything?"
    },
    {
      "start": 761.2,
      "end": 766.88,
      "text": "What have we done?"
    },
    {
      "start": 763.04,
      "end": 770.36,
      "text": "I would die for I would die for die. I"
    },
    {
      "start": 766.88,
      "end": 770.36,
      "text": "would die for"
    },
    {
      "start": 773.563,
      "end": 777.56,
      "text": "[music]"
    },
    {
      "start": 774.56,
      "end": 777.56,
      "text": "go."
    },
    {
